"content": "<h1>香料*</h1><p>黃耆屬（Astragalus）灌木樹液製成的黃蓍膠（tragacanth）的通稱，也是古代的貿易商品（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01043011\" data-end-ref=\"01043011\">創43:11</data>）。這類灌木廣泛生長於古代近東。<em>黃</em>蓍（Astragalus tragacantha）的香料至今仍作商業用途。<em>見</em> <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"6929\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">植物</data>（<data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"2693\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">蘆薈，乳</data><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"3152\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">香，</data><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"6421\" data-resource-code=\"AquiferOpenBibleDictionary\">沒藥</data>）。</p>",
"associations": {
